  text = "Skyborne are a neutral race picked per faction at character creation: Alliance = High Order Skyborne, Horde = Windshaper Skyborne. Mage is Alliance-only (High Order); Shaman is Horde-only. Skyborne classes: Druid, Hunter, Mage (Alliance), Rogue, Shaman (Horde), Warrior. Starting zone Zephras Isle; unlocked by the Skyborne Heroic Pack or higher special editions. Icy Veins rates Skyborne the best Mage race for long encounters (Read Ley Line + Wind Blessed with Mage's Spirit-based regen; Elemental Insight vs Elementals). Mage races: Human, Gnome, High Order Skyborne, Orc, Troll, Undead.",
